                <head>Appendix G to HD–60</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Note on Blockade of Bolshevist
                        Russia</hi></p>
                <p>[The same, except in French, as the note attached to appendix H, infrawith a
                    final paragraph which reads as follows:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">[Translation]</p>
                <p>“It will be understood that the war vessels of an Allied or Associated Power
                    charged with the execution of the above measures, will act in the name of all
                    the Allied and Associated Powers.”]</p>
            </div>
